    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 318072924971008
    m_Localized: Artist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 318294300336128
    m_Localized: Steal one card from an opponent's hand. Stolen card must be played
      right away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 318212704346112
    m_Localized: Collector
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 318134820315136
    m_Localized: Re-roll one of your dice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 319708602867712
    m_Localized: Dice modifier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 319965743063040
    m_Localized: Choose one die, either your own or an opponent and apply a +1 or
      -1 modifier.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 322112295575552
    m_Localized: Special Collector
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 321988571996160
    m_Localized: Special Artist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 321900101541888
    m_Localized: Special Bodyguard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 321386253164544
    m_Localized: Special Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 321815577927680
    m_Localized: 'Choose one:

      -All opponents re-roll one die.

      -One
      opponent re-rolls all dice.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 322199511932928
    m_Localized: 'Choose one:

      -Draw three cards from the deck. They go to
      your hand and may be played in future turns.

      -Steal one card from each
      opponent. Choose one of those to play right away and discard the rest.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 321961501958144
    m_Localized: 'Choose one:

      -Protect all of your dice (they cannot be affected
      by card effects).

      -Protect all dice of all players (they cannot be affected
      by card effects). '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 322050706415616
    m_Localized: 'Choose one:

      -Pick any number of your dice and re-roll them.

      -Re-roll
      one of your dice three times and then pick one of those values to be the final
      value of the die.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 339569911570432
    m_Localized: Mirror
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 339628434694144
    m_Localized: Swap one of your dice with an opponent's. You may keep the die for
      later turns or play it straight away
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 339649573986304
    m_Localized: Executioner
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 339696617299968
    m_Localized: Prevent a rival from using cards this turn or cancel a persistent
      card already used (persistent cards remain on the board after played, either
      under the die they are affecting or on the side if they affect all dice).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 342140713738240
    m_Localized: Choose the effect of one of the cards' special variants (Knight,
      Bodyguard, Artist, Collector).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
